l reconstruction, that did not present medical and/or physiotherapeutic release for physical/sports activities, who have participated in strength training program for the plantar flexors in the last 6 months, patients with diabetic diseases, as well as those with difficulty for understanding and/or executing the test and training protocols in the isokinetic dynamometer will be excluded.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Volunteers that did"\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "NOT": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "not have Achilles tendon surgical reconstruction, that did",\n              "Negation": [\n                "not"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "Achilles tendon surgical reconstruction"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "Achilles tendon surgical reconstruction"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "NOT": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "not present medical",\n                      "Negation": [\n                        "not"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "medical"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "and/or physiotherapeutic release",\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "release"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation-Name": [\n                            "release"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "physiotherapeutic"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "for physical/",\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "physical"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "sports activities, who have participated in strength training program for the plantar flexors in the last 6 months, patients with diabetic diseases,",\n                                  "Procedure": [\n                                    "strength training program"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "last 6 months"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                    "last"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Value": [\n                                    "6"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                    "months"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "sports activities",\n                                    "plantar flexors"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                                    "strength training program"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "diabetic diseases"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "diabetic diseases"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                        