e within the last six months\n-  patients allergic to Percocet or acetaminophen\n-  patients taking tricyclic antidepressants (interaction with bupivacaine)\n-  vulnerable populations (prisoners or pregnant women)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- allergy to bupivacaine",\n                  "Allergy": [\n                    "allergy"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "bupivacaine"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug-Name": [\n                    "bupivacaine"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- pre-operative opioid usage within the last six months",\n                  "Age": [\n                    "age"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "opioid"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "within the last six months"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug-Name": [\n                    "opioid"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "within"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "last"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "six"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "months"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "operative"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "operative"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- patients allergic to Percocet",\n                  "Allergy": [\n                    "allergic"\n   