itions: Chron\'s disease, bleeding disorders, gastrointestinal or colonic malignancy, Kidney disease, including kidney "stones" or hypercalcemia, Coagulopathy/hereditary hemorrhagic disorders/ or receiving therapeutic doses of Coumadin or heparin.\n-  Ingested certain medications (Calcium, Vitamin D, fiber supplements and Non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs - NSAIDs) within 30 days of study start.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "-"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "NOT": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "No history or diagnosis of any of the following conditions: Chron\'s disease,",\n                  "Negation": [\n                    "No"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "history"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "conditions",\n                    "Chron\'s disease"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "history"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Chron\'s disease"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "bleeding disorders, gastrointestinal",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "bleeding disorders"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "gastrointestinal"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "bleeding disorders"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "or colonic malignancy,",\n                          "Modifier": [\n           