an nicotine dependence\n-  Medical conditions that might affect brain function\n-  Current use of medications that could alter brain function\n-  Pregnancy\n-  Current illicit drug use other than occasional use of marijuana\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- History of any Axis I psychiatric diagnosis other than nicotine dependence",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "psychiatric diagnosis",\n                    "nicotine dependence"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "psychiatric diagnosis",\n                    "nicotine dependence"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "Axis I",\n                    "History"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Unit": [\n                    "Axis"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "I"\n                  ],\n                  "Exception": [\n                    "other than"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "History"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Medical conditions that might affect brain function",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Medical conditions"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "brain function"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "brain function"\n                  ],\n                  "Stability": [\n                    "affect"\n                  ],\n                  "Assertion": [\n                    "might"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Current use of med