gy, hypersensibility or resistance to local anesthetic\n-  Contraindication to regional anesthesia: infection in the designated area, severe congenital coagulopathy or inadequate hemostasis before PIFB\n-  Severe hepatic (Child B and C) or renal insufficiency (GFR<30 mL/min)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patient\'s refusal or inability to consent",\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "l"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "-"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Allergy, hypersensibility",\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "l"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "-"\n                  ],\n                  "Allergy": [\n                    "Allergy"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "hypersensibility"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "hypersensibility"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or resistance to local anesthetic",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "local anesthetic"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "local anesthetic"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "l"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "resistance"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "resistance"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Contraindication to regional anesthesia: infection in the designated area, severe conge