linical condition oppose an examination with both modalities (ULDCT of the chest, chest X-ray)\n-  assigned to chest X-ray as follow-up\n-  women with positive ß-HCG-test\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- the emergency departments assessment of a critical clinical condition oppose an examination with both modalities (ULDCT of the chest,",\n              "Location": [\n                "emergency department",\n                "emergency departments"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "assessment",\n                "examination",\n                "ULDCT"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "assessment",\n                "examination",\n                "ULDCT"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "clinical condition"\n              ],\n              "Severity": [\n                "critical"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "both modalities",\n                "chest"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "oppose"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "chest X-ray)",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "chest X-ray",\n                "X-ray"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "chest X-ray",\n                "X-ray"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "chest"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- assigned to chest X-ray as follow-up",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "chest X-ray",\n            "X-ray"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "chest X-ray",\n            "X-ray"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "chest"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "assigned"\n   