rnal septorhinoplasty: patients seen in consultation because of nasal obstruction were evaluated. Patients who had symptoms of nasal obstruction for at least 1 year that were the result of an identifiable anatomical cause such as septal deviation, turbinate hypertrophy, internal valve collapse, or external valve collapse were included in the study.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- at least 18 years old",\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "years",\n        "year"\n      ],\n      "Age": [\n        "old"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "18",\n        "1"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "at least 18 years"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "at least"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients eligible for external septorhinoplasty: patients seen in consultation because of nasal obstruction were evaluated. Patients who had symptoms of nasal obstruction for at least 1 year that were the result of an identifiable anatomical cause such as septal deviation,",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "septorhinoplasty"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "septorhinoplasty"\n          ],\n          "Condition": [\n            "nasal obstruction",\n            "septal deviation"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "nasal obstruction",\n            "septal deviation"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "at least"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "1"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "at least 1 year"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "year"\n          ],\n          "Encounter": [\n            "seen"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "symptoms"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "external"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n             