 65 years (inclusive) on the day of signing informed consent\n-  Diagnosis of active rheumatoid arthritis, psoriatic arthritis, ankylosing spondylitis or, non-radiographic axial spondyloarthritis for at least 12 weeks prior to screening, meeting the corresponding specific disease classification criteria as specified in the protocol\nKey\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Male",\n              "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                "Male"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "participants who are between the ages of 21 and 65 years (inclusive) on the day of signing informed consent",\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "years"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "21",\n                "65"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "between the ages of 21 and 65 years"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "between"\n              ],\n              "Age": [\n                "ages"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Diagnosis of active rheumatoid arthritis,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "rheumatoid arthritis"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "rheumatoid arthritis"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "active"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "active"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "psoriatic arthritis,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "psoriatic arthritis"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                