ils.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients diagnosed with dementia (infection, vascular, hematological diseases), patients who could not be contacted during the follow-up period or who did not come to control, cardiac and cerebrovascular event,\n-  Endocrine disorder, fluid-electrolyte imbalance and infection\n-  Patients with malignancy and malignancy, chemotherapy and radiotherapy,\n-  Patients with delirium or depression\n-  Those with protective sensation loss (those with Semmes-Weinstein Monofilament Thickness 4.56 and above)\n-  patients with lower or upper extremity amputations at any level\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Patients diagnosed with dementia (infection,",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "dementia",\n                            "infection"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "dementia",\n                            "infection"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "-"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "vascular,",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "vascular"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "vascular"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "hematological diseases), patients who could",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "hematological diseases"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "hematological diseases"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                                    "to"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "NOT": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "OR": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "not be contacted during the follow-up period",\n                                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                                            "-"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Observation": [\n                                            "contacted"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Observation-Name": [\n                                            "contacted"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Negation": [\n                                            "not"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Study": [\n                                            "follow-up period"\n                                          ]\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "AND": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "raw_text": "or who did"\n                                            },\n                                            "right": {\n                                              "NOT": {\n                                                "left": {\n                                                  "OR": {\n                                                    "left": {\n                                                      "raw_text": "not come to control, cardiac",\n                                                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                                                        "to"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Negation": [\n                                                        "not"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Modifier": [\n                                                        "cardiac"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Observation": [\n                                                        "control"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                                        "control"\n                                                      ]\n                                                    },\n                                                    "right": {\n                                                      "raw_text": "and cerebrovascular event,",\n                                                      "Condition": [\n                                                        "vascular"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Condition-Name": [\n                                                        "vascular"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Observation": [\n                                                        "event"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                                        "event"\n                                                      ],\n                                                      "Modifier": [\n                                                        "cerebrovascular"\n                                                      ]\n                                                    }\n                                                  }\n                                                }\n                                              }\n                                            }\n                                          }\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Endocrine disorder, fluid-electrolyte imbalance",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "Endocrine disorder",\n                            "fluid-electrolyte imbalance"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "Endocrine disorder",\n                            "fluid-electrolyte imbalance"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "-"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "and infection",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "infection"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "infection"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Patients with malignancy",\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "-"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "malignancy"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "malignancy"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "and malignancy, chemotherapy",\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "chemotherapy"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "chemotherapy"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "malignancy"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "malignancy"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "and radiotherapy,",\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "radiotherapy"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "radiotherapy"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patients with delirium",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "delirium"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "delirium"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "-"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or depression",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "depression"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "depression"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Those with protective sensation loss (those with Semmes-Weinstein Monofilament Thickness 4.56 and above)",\n          "Condition": [\n            "protective sensation loss"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "protective sensation loss"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "-",\n            "and above"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "4.56"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "Semmes-Weinstein Monofilament Thickness"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "Semmes-Weinstein Monofilament Thickness"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "4.56 and above"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- patients with lower",\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "-"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "lower"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "or upper extremity amputations at any level",\n          "Condition": [\n            "amputations"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "amputations"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "upper extremity"\n          ]\n     