illness that might be responsible for the spinal curvature.\n-  Patients with symptom of a neurological disorder.\n-  Patients with any other disorder of the musculoskeletal system affecting the lower limbs,\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Diagnosis of other musculoskeletal",\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "-"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "musculoskeletal"\n              ],\n              "Other": [\n                "other"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or developmental illness that might be responsible for the spinal curvature.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "illness",\n                "spinal curvature"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "developmental"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "spinal curvature"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "might be"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients with symptom of a neurological disorder.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "neurological disorder"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "neurological disorder"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "-"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "symptom"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients with any other disorder of the musculoskeletal system affecting the lower limbs,",\n      "Condition": [\n        "disorder of the musculoskeletal system"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "disorder of the musculoskeletal system"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "-"\n      ],\n      "Modifier": [\n        "musculoskeletal",\n        "lower limbs"\n      ],\n  